# Databricks safety

Match Unity Catalog and workspace names already used in the repo. Do not point
jobs at a different catalog or workspace in a local fix.

Do not use `SELECT *` in production jobs without a limit or explicit column
list the surrounding notebooks already follow.

Never commit personal access tokens, cluster credentials, or `DATABRICKS_TOKEN`
values. Use the project's secret scope.

Honor existing cluster policies. Do not request unrestricted clusters when
the repo pins a policy.
